<title>JAPAN: Nissho Iwai - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissho Iwai - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.65 trln	 vs	    4.23 trln</p>
<p> Operating	    9.60		vs	    7.19</p>
<p> Current		9.31		vs	    8.72</p>
<p> Net		    8.76		vs	    2.80</p>
<p> EPS		   10.89 yen	  vs	    3.57 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     874 million	 vs	  784 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissho Iwai Corp is a large trading company.</p>
